   12 | void dump_page(struct page *page, const char *reason);
      |                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~
cc1: all warnings being treated as errors
make[2]: *** [scripts/Makefile.build:250: mm/hugetlb.o] Error 1
make[1]: *** [scripts/Makefile.build:500: mm] Error 2
